				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				116,
				1
			],
			"Message": "chore(Element): Synchronize core submodules for API modularization and dependency updates\n\nUpdate the Element submodule to decompose monolithic window namespace factories and refine the UI bridge architecture. In Cocoon, split `Window/Namespace.ts` into distinct PascalCase factory modules (`CreateOutputChannel`, `CreateStatusBarItem`, `CreateTerminal`, `CreateWebviewPanel`) to enforce separation of concerns, implement lazy `processId` resolution, and add React mount safeguards. Refactor Sky's `Bridge.ts` into domain-specific installers (`InstallCommands`, `InstallSimpleRelays`) using dynamic imports to reduce static dependency graphs and activate dormant Mountain-to-Sky event channels.\n\nConcurrently apply upstream dependency patches, upgrading `pnpm/action-setup`, `astro`, `zod`, and `@xterm/xterm` in Output and Sky. Merge `Common`, `Echo`, `Mountain`, `Rest`, `Wind`, and `Worker` to their latest states to ensure the editor benefits from the latest security and performance fixes.\n\nThese changes restore the architectural pattern of dedicated factory modules, enable finer-grained unit testing for UI proxies, and align the codebase with the latest upstream stability updates.",
			"SHA": "6466d00e1daaf2403c6fa78fdf2278a5e73d2146"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-04T20:06:27Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				116,
				1
			],
			"Message": "chore(Element): Regenerate build artifacts and RouteManifest after hierarchy update\n\nTrigger a full recompilation of the TypeScript source and ESBuild bundling pipeline within the Cocoon component to synchronize the `Target/` directory with the recently updated strict PascalCase source hierarchy.\n\nThe `RouteManifest.ts` is regenerated with a fresh timestamp to reflect the current build cycle, ensuring all compiled JavaScript bundles and source maps accurately represent the latest code state. This maintenance step guarantees consistency across the extension host dependency graph, including gRPC clients, VSCodeAPI handlers, and Mountain integration layers, preventing runtime discrepancies between the source tree and the bundled artifact consumed by the editor.",
			"SHA": "dadfd1af82c86679fecfab5c179dc4a009fc73e1"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-04T19:56:40Z",
			"File": [
				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				116,
				2
			],
			"Message": "chore(Project): Finalize PascalCase migration and update smoke test paths\n\nUpdate the Element submodule to complete the strict PascalCase directory hierarchy migration across six core components (Cocoon, Output, Mountain, Sky, Common, Wind) and adjust the integration smoke test scripts to reflect new artifact paths.\n\nThe Element update restructures the Cocoon source tree, aligns Output's ESBuild pipeline, extends Mountain's IPC timeouts to 5000ms for cold-boot stability, and activates dormant Tauri event relays in Sky. Concurrently, Maintain/Integration/SmokeProfiles.sh is updated to reference the relocated `Cocoon/Main.js` bundle, ensuring the verification suite correctly detects the new build artifacts.\n\nThese changes eliminate module resolution failures in the Tauri environment, prevent startup freezes, and ensure build diagnostics accurately reflect the current codebase structure.",
			"SHA": "4bbae8eb7cb049307fc5d0966f493e4486947400"
		},
